OL,3,GNEWSAThe portal giving Brummies a live
OL,4,Alink to Germany
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is not every day that a walk through
OL,7,FBirmingham city centre leads to a
OL,8,Fconversation with someone hundreds of
OL,9,Fmiles away in Germany.
OL,11,FBut that is exactly what is happening
OL,12,Finside a brightly decorated shipping
OL,13,Fcontainer that has appeared outside the
OL,14,FHippodrome.
OL,16,FStep through the door and, for a few
OL,17,Fminutes at least, Frankfurt feels a lot
OL,18,Fcloser than 480 miles away.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,352,350,200,160,0,100
