OL,3,GNEWSAThe portal giving Brummies a live
OL,4,Alink to Germany
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe installation is part of Sister
OL,7,FCities Dialogue, a project marking 60
OL,8,Fyears of friendship between Birmingham
OL,9,Fand Frankfurt. Through a life-sized
OL,10,Fdigital portal, people in the two
OL,11,Fcities can sit down together, chat and
OL,12,Fshare a glimpse of their daily lives.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
